{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13567","headline":"山中崔大夫有书相问 · 秦系","name":"山中崔大夫有书相问","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客在烟霞里，闲闲逐狎鸥。\n终年常裸足，连日半蓬头。\n带月乘渔艇，迎寒绽鹿裘。\n已于人事少，多被挂冠留。\n素业堆千卷，清风至一丘。\n苍黄倒藜杖，伛偻覩银钩。\n迹愧巢由隐，才非管乐俦。\n从来自多病，不是傲王侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦系","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}